      "content": "it's not really a recurring thing, it just started today. i don't have a fever or anything, just this dull ache. i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always forever. you mentioned appendix but it's really not that bad of a pain, just annoying. do you think it's actually serious or can i just wait and see if it goes away by morning if i take some advil?",
